{"case_id": "male_20070131_P008-Q38", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主的身材外貌如何？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主提供的紫微斗数信息，命宫在酉，主星为天相（陷）。天相星在紫微斗数中属水，为印星，通常代表斯文、清秀、皮肤白皙的外貌特征，即使处于陷落状态，其基调仍偏向文雅气质。身宫在巳，主星天府（得），天府属土，为库星，象征稳重、和善，可能略带圆润感。命宫主先天外貌，天相陷可能使身材中等甚至偏瘦，但不至过于矮小或丑陋；加之地支酉金亦有白皙之意。综合来看，命主先天更符合天相的秀气温文特征，而非高大魁梧或蜡黄扁平，天府身宫的影响在后天虽可能增添福态，但先天基础仍以清秀为主。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b2b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "male_20070131_P008-Q38", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b2b_R2_P3_G4\\details_2024_b2b_R2_P3_G4.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 10079, "response_id": "924992a2-6a0b-4cd2-a2f7-4e0c7c7fe8ad", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 260, "completion_tokens": 494, "total_tokens": 754, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 312}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4}}
